<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- DSM posts NLG 465 mln H1 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE- DSM posts NLG 465 mln H1 net.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinary items     465  vs  413</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)		 15.40  vs   12.65</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items			    NIL  vs   10 charge</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (guilders)		  3.00 vs 2.65</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had forecast DSM NV's first-half net profit at between 452 and 544 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Net sales (billions)			  6.12  vs  5.19</p>
<p>    Operating profit				 642  vs  582</p>
<p>    Financial charges				 35  vs   28</p>
<p>    Tax						  182  vs  163</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
